  "texts": [
    {
      "text": "Il est huit heures et demie.",
      "sha256": "c08bbe771583686bef66c1daee13c9c65e3ff710fcf2d7fb5e975173f6dd3ca6",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "draftLessonKey": "foundation:2",
          "field": "cards[15].targetFrench"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Luis : Le café coûte trois euros la tasse ; le jus, quatre euros le verre.",
      "sha256": "5da8a946d206d71fe0dbb3b52a7b121910379634d6948469b28503c4eea2f969",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "draftLessonKey": "foundation:2",
          "field": "reader[5].targetFrench"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Luis : C’est deux euros la pièce, ou vingt euros la douzaine.",
      "sha256": "80da42a825710108d414458e7b9ee9a0c13a5cf3b1948dffd39b4ecc56377d7e",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "draftLessonKey": "foundation:2",
          "field": "reader[7].targetFrench"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Daniel : Le café est très chaud, mais le jus est froid.",
      "sha256": "9c99bd4f6487aef4a9fa493df20ded76fcada79fd03e90281b94d3203972f135",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "draftLessonKey": "foundation:3",
          "field": "reader[8].targetFrench"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Daniel : La sauce au piment est très piquante, mais elle est délicieuse.",
      "sha256": "c5128112b51f3e09cb1790469ffd743dbe0909a79409a5ab45db7eef4a8f0f25",
      "occurrences": [
